  "en": "Algebra of events; mutually exclusive and exhaustive events",
  "kn": "ಘಟನೆಗಳ ಬೀಜಗಣಿತ; ಪರಸ್ಪರ ವರ್ಜಿತ ಮತ್ತು ಸಮಗ್ರ ಘಟನೆಗಳು"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "A or B, A and B",
    "kn": "A ಅಥವಾ B, A ಮತ್ತು B"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "A king or a heart, a king and a heart, a king but not a heart: the words or, and, but not are set operations in disguise.",
    "kn": "ರಾಜ ಅಥವಾ ಹೃದಯ, ರಾಜ ಮತ್ತು ಹೃದಯ, ರಾಜ ಆದರೆ ಹೃದಯವಲ್ಲ: ಅಥವಾ, ಮತ್ತು, ಆದರೆ-ಅಲ್ಲ ಎಂಬ ಪದಗಳು ಗಣ ಕ್ರಿಯೆಗಳೇ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Translate or, and, not and but not into set operations"
    },
    {
     "en": "Decide whether events are mutually exclusive or exhaustive"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "A king or a heart, a king and a heart, a king but not a heart: the words or, and, but not are set operations in disguise.",
    "kn": "ರಾಜ ಅಥವಾ ಹೃದಯ, ರಾಜ ಮತ್ತು ಹೃದಯ, ರಾಜ ಆದರೆ ಹೃದಯವಲ್ಲ: ಅಥವಾ, ಮತ್ತು, ಆದರೆ-ಅಲ್ಲ ಎಂಬ ಪದಗಳು ಗಣ ಕ್ರಿಯೆಗಳೇ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Algebra of events"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "\"A or B\" is $A \\cup B$; \"A and B\" is $A \\cap B$; \"A but not B\" is $A - B = A \\cap B'$; \"not A\" is $A'$.",
    "kn": "\"ಅಥವಾ\" ಎಂದರೆ ಸಂಯೋಗ ∪, \"ಮತ್ತು\" ಎಂದರೆ ಛೇದನ ∩, \"ಆದರೆ ಅಲ್ಲ\" ಎಂದರೆ ವ್ಯತ್ಯಾಸ, \"ಅಲ್ಲ\" ಎಂದರೆ ಪೂರಕ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "A or B = A ∪ B"
    },
    {
     "en": "A and B = A ∩ B"
    },
    {
     "en": "A but not B = A ∩ B′"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Or means union, and means intersection, but not means difference, and not means complement.",
    "kn": "\"ಅಥವಾ\" ಎಂದರೆ ಸಂಯೋಗ ∪, \"ಮತ್ತು\" ಎಂದರೆ ಛೇದನ ∩, \"ಆದರೆ ಅಲ್ಲ\" ಎಂದರೆ ವ್ಯತ್ಯಾಸ, \"ಅಲ್ಲ\" ಎಂದರೆ ಪೂರಕ."
   }
  },
